        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDL60, Contemporary Sliding Pocket Door Privacy Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pocket lock is for use on sliding pocket doors. A privacy set, it is for doors that may need to be locked such as those found leading into bedrooms and bathrooms. An emergency turn on the exterior can unlock it. Standard duty for use on 1-3/8\" thick pocket doors. The Large Contemporary Pocket Door Privacy Lock will fit a common standard 2-1/4\" x 1-3/4\" door cutout. It has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<table width=\"177\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDP60-Specifications.gif?v=1704354625\" width=\"177\" height=\"298\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDL60 Contemporary Pocket Door Privacy Lock Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/large-contemporary-pocket-door-passage-set-deltana-sdp60\"><b>Large Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDL60 Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-1/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Emergency lock release on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL60.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDL60 Dimensions  (PDF)</a></li>\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL25-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDL25 Installation Instructions (PDF)</a></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
